  "summary": "OpenCode is an open-source AI coding agent from Anomaly, written in TypeScript. Since version 2, one background server per user owns sessions, permissions and tool execution, and the terminal UI, desktop app and web UI connect to it; ACP clients such as Zed can also run it, and an SDK embeds the same server in other apps. It works with models from many providers, including local ones, and an optional hosted Console adds shared provider keys, paid models and budgets for teams.",
